    "summary": "Use it in the opposing player's Shooting phase or either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit picks its targets.\n\nPick a **GREY KNIGHTS INFANTRY** unit of yours that at least 1 of those attacks targets. Until the phase ends, each time 1 of its models that has yet to shoot or fight this phase is **destroyed**, roll a D6. On a 4+, leave the model in play: it may shoot or fight once the attacking unit has made all its attacks, then remove it.",
